flowchart TD
    A[Doctor Login] --> B{Account Activated?}
    B -->|No| C[Account Pending<br/>Contact Clinic Owner]
    B -->|Yes| D[Dashboard]
    
    %% Dashboard to Profile Navigation
    D --> D1[Navigation Menu<br/>Main sidebar/header]
    D1 --> D1a[Profile Menu Item<br/>User avatar/name click]
